    deprecated_removed_spec_closure_capture_mutation_not_visible_2026_11_10, 0, "test/system/code_quality/deprecated_removed_spec.spl:171 and :194: closure passed to text_each / each pushes into a captured outer var (seen: [text]/[i64]); after the call seen is empty (expected 0 to equal 3, 0 to equal 6). Interpreter/seed closure capture of a mutable outer var does not write back. Spec is correct; left red. Repro: bin/simple test test/system/code_quality/deprecated_removed_spec.spl (11 pass, 2 fail). Unblock: closure mutable capture write-back in the interpreter."

